OL,3,GNEWSAGirl killed in crash near Highgate
OL,4,ASchool
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old girl has been killed in a
OL,7,Fcrash as she made her way to Highgate
OL,8,FSchool in north London.
OL,10,FThe Met Police said officers were
OL,11,Fcalled to North Road, Highgate, at
OL,12,Fabout 08:15 BST following reports of a
OL,13,Fcollision involving a pedestrian and
OL,14,Fcar.
OL,16,FThe girl, a Year 12 pupil, was
OL,17,Fpronounced dead at the scene, near the
OL,18,Fprivate school's main site. The driver
OL,19,Fof the car, a 68-year-old man, remained
OL,20,Fat the scene and was arrested on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of causing death by careless
OL,22,Fdriving.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
