OL,3,GNEWSAGirl killed in crash near Highgate
OL,4,ASchool
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Highgate School said
OL,7,Fthe girl was on her way to school when
OL,8,Fshe was killed. "This incredibly
OL,9,Fdistressing news has come as a terrible
OL,10,Fshock to everyone at Highgate," they
OL,11,Fsaid in a statement.
